tesseract-planning provides CMake targets.
The CMake package name is tesseract_planning (not the vcpkg port name):

  find_package(tesseract_planning CONFIG REQUIRED)
  target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE
      tesseract::command_language
      tesseract::motion_planners_ompl
      tesseract::motion_planners_trajopt
      tesseract::motion_planners_descartes
      tesseract::task_composer)

Config files live in share/tesseract_planning/. Plugin DLLs are in bin/; put that directory on PATH at runtime.
